Johto_Std_AlanAskNumber1Text:
	.string "Reading textbooks\n"
	.string "is worthwhile\l"
	.string "every so often."
	.string "\pWhen I'm reading\n"
	.string "and walking, I\l"
	.string "have to look down."
	.string "\pSo I notice items\n"
	.string "on the ground."
	.string "\pNext time I find\n"
	.string "something, I'll\l"
	.string "give it to you."
	.string "\pMay I have your\n"
	.string "phone number?$"

Johto_Std_AlanAskNumber2Text:
	.string "If I find some-\n"
	.string "thing, it's yours."
	.string "\pSo may I have your\n"
	.string "phone number?$"

Johto_Std_AlanGiftText:
	.string "This, this! This\n"
	.string "is yours! Ta-da!$"

Johto_Std_AlanNumberAcceptedText:
	.string "I'll call you as\n"
	.string "soon as I find"
	.string "\psomething. You can\n"
	.string "count on it!$"

Johto_Std_AlanNumberDeclinedText:
	.string "Oh… I thought it\n"
	.string "would be a good"
	.string "\pbreak to call you\n"
	.string "when I'm studying…$"

Johto_Std_AlanPackFullText:
	.string "Whoops!"
	.string "\pYou can't carry\n"
	.string "any more items!"
	.string "\pI'll hold it until\n"
	.string "next time.$"

Johto_Std_AlanPhoneFullText:
	.string "There's no room\n"
	.string "for my number.$"

Johto_Std_AlanRematchText:
	.string "I waited around\n"
	.string "for you!"
	.string "\pI'm thoroughly\n"
	.string "prepared today!$"

Johto_Std_AnthonyAskNumber1Text:
	.string "By the way, I'm a\n"
	.string "HIKER, so I often"
	.string "\pgo to mountains\n"
	.string "and caves."
	.string "\pI occasionally see\n"
	.string "rare POKéMON."
	.string "\pI could call you\n"
	.string "the next time I\l"
	.string "see one."
	.string "\pFeel like swapping\n"
	.string "phone numbers?$"

Johto_Std_AnthonyAskNumber2Text:
	.string "I could call you\n"
	.string "when I see some\l"
	.string "rare POKéMON."
	.string "\pFeel like swapping\n"
	.string "phone numbers?$"

Johto_Std_AnthonyNumberAcceptedText:
	.string "Be patient. I'll\n"
	.string "find some rare\l"
	.string "POKéMON for you!$"

Johto_Std_AnthonyNumberDeclinedText:
	.string "You're cold. I may\n"
	.string "as well head to\l"
	.string "the mountains…$"

Johto_Std_AnthonyPhoneFullText:
	.string "Your phone's full."
	.string "\pIt can't register\n"
	.string "my phone number.$"

Johto_Std_AnthonyRematchText:
	.string "All righty, then!"
	.string "\pMy POKéMON and I\n"
	.string "are raring to go!$"

Johto_Std_ArnieAskNumber1Text:
	.string "Do you get the\n"
	.string "feeling that there"
	.string "\pare more rare\n"
	.string "POKéMON around?"
	.string "\pI'm positive there\n"
	.string "are, so I look all\l"
	.string "the time."
	.string "\pIf I find one, I\n"
	.string "want to share the"
	.string "\pgood news with\n"
	.string "everyone I know."
	.string "\pI know! Give me\n"
	.string "your phone number.$"

Johto_Std_ArnieAskNumber2Text:
	.string "I want to let\n"
	.string "people know if I\l"
	.string "see rare POKéMON."
	.string "\pPlease give me\n"
	.string "your phone number!$"

Johto_Std_ArnieNumberAcceptedText:
	.string "If I spot any\n"
	.string "awesome POKéMON,"
	.string "\pI'll be sure to\n"
	.string "give you a call!$"

Johto_Std_ArnieNumberDeclinedText:
	.string "Aww! I want to\n"
	.string "tell someone about\l"
	.string "my discoveries!$"

Johto_Std_ArniePhoneFullText:
	.string "There's no space\n"
	.string "for my number."
	.string "\pIf you make room,\n"
	.string "register me!$"

Johto_Std_ArnieRematchText:
	.string "It's my turn to\n"
	.string "win now!"
	.string "\pI've turned over a\n"
	.string "new leaf!$"

