Johto_Std_BethAskNumber1Text:
	.string "It's been a while\n"
	.string "since I lost…"
	.string "\pYou're very good\n"
	.string "at battling."
	.string "\pWe should battle\n"
	.string "again sometime."
	.string "\pBy challenging a\n"
	.string "tough trainer like"
	.string "\pyou, I think I can\n"
	.string "get better too."
	.string "\pSo how about it?"
	.string "\pWould you give me\n"
	.string "your phone number?$"

Johto_Std_BethAskNumber2Text:
	.string "By challenging a\n"
	.string "tough trainer like"
	.string "\pyou, I think I can\n"
	.string "get better too."
	.string "\pSo how about it?"
	.string "\pWould you give me\n"
	.string "your phone number?$"

Johto_Std_BethNumberAcceptedText:
	.string "Let's battle again\n"
	.string "sometime!$"

Johto_Std_BethNumberDeclinedText:
	.string "That's too bad…"
	.string "\pLet me know if you\n"
	.string "change your mind.$"

Johto_Std_BethPhoneFullText:
	.string "Oh no. Your phone\n"
	.string "is out of memory.$"

Johto_Std_BethRematchText:
	.string "You sure kept me\n"
	.string "waiting! Let's go!$"

Johto_Std_BeverlyAskNumber1Text:
	.string "Your MARILL is so\n"
	.string "cute and adorable!"
	.string "\pYou love POKéMON\n"
	.string "just like I do!"
	.string "\pWant to trade\n"
	.string "phone numbers?"
	.string "\pLet's chat! It'll\n"
	.string "be so much fun!$"

Johto_Std_BeverlyAskNumber2Text:
	.string "Your MARILL is so\n"
	.string "cute and adorable!"
	.string "\pWe should chat, it\n"
	.string "will be fun."
	.string "\pCan I have your\n"
	.string "phone number?$"

Johto_Std_BeverlyGiftText:
	.string "Oh? {PLAYER}? \n"
	.string "I waited here for"
	.string "\pyou. I brought you\n"
	.string "a little gift.$"

Johto_Std_BeverlyNumberAcceptedText:
	.string "To be honest, I\n"
	.string "want a MARILL."
	.string "\pBut I make do with\n"
	.string "my cute SNUBBULL.$"

Johto_Std_BeverlyNumberDeclinedText:
	.string "Oh… That's\n"
	.string "disappointing…"
	.string "\pGoodbye, MARILL…$"

Johto_Std_BeverlyPackFullText:
	.string "Oh?\n"
	.string "You have no room."
	.string "\pPlease come back\n"
	.string "for it later.$"

Johto_Std_BeverlyPhoneFullText:
	.string "Oh? Your phone's\n"
	.string "memory is full.$"

Johto_Std_BrentAskNumber1Text:
	.string "By the way, you're\n"
	.string "a POKéMANIAC…"
	.string "\pI can tell.\n"
	.string "Yes, you are."
	.string "\pBut your knowledge\n"
	.string "is shallow still!"
	.string "\pDo you know BILL?\n"
	.string "He's an incredible"
	.string "\pPOKéMANIAC.\n"
	.string "I revere him."
	.string "\pI'll teach you all\n"
	.string "I know about BILL,"
	.string "\pso leave me your\n"
	.string "phone number.$"

Johto_Std_BrentAskNumber2Text:
	.string "I'll teach you all\n"
	.string "I know about BILL,"
	.string "\pso leave me your\n"
	.string "phone number.$"

Johto_Std_BrentNumberAcceptedText:
	.string "BILL--he's more\n"
	.string "than amazing!"
	.string "\pTo be a POKéMANIAC\n"
	.string "like him someday…"
	.string "\pThat's my dream.$"

Johto_Std_BrentNumberDeclinedText:
	.string "You're going to\n"
	.string "regret it…"
	.string "\pAnd I won't care…$"

Johto_Std_BrentPhoneFullText:
	.string "Huh? Your phone\n"
	.string "list's full."
	.string "\pA POKéMANIAC has\n"
	.string "to be more tidy!$"

Johto_Std_BrentRematchText:
	.string "I've been waiting."
	.string "\pLook, check out my\n"
	.string "POKéMON!$"

Johto_Std_ChadAskNumber1Text:
	.string "Huh? Is that thing\n"
	.string "a POKéDEX? Have\l"
	.string "you met PROF.OAK?"
	.string "\pHuh? You have? \n"
	.string "That's way cool!"
	.string "\pI have a dream of\n"
	.string "becoming a POKéMON"
	.string "\presearcher like\n"
	.string "PROF.OAK."
	.string "\pMay I please have\n"
	.string "your phone number?"
	.string "\pWe should chat\n"
	.string "about PROF.OAK."
	.string "\pI'm sure it will\n"
	.string "be loads of fun!$"

Johto_Std_ChadAskNumber2Text:
	.string "May I please have\n"
	.string "your phone number?"
	.string "\pWe should chat\n"
	.string "about PROF.OAK."
	.string "\pI'm sure it will\n"
	.string "be loads of fun!$"

Johto_Std_ChadNumberAcceptedText:
	.string "You must listen to\n"
	.string "PROF.OAK'S POKéMON\l"
	.string "TALK, right?$"

Johto_Std_ChadNumberDeclinedText:
	.string "Oh… I wish I had a\n"
	.string "chance to meet\l"
	.string "PROF.OAK…$"

Johto_Std_ChadPhoneFullText:
	.string "Your phone list is\n"
	.string "completely full!$"

Johto_Std_ChadRematchText:
	.string "I've been waiting!\n"
