Johto_Std_IrwinAskNumber1Text:
	.string "You're the best\n"
	.string "I've ever battled!"
	.string "\pHuh? You're the\n"
	.string "one who saved all\l"
	.string "the SLOWPOKE?"
	.string "\pWell, no wonder I\n"
	.string "couldn't beat you!"
	.string "\pWould it be OK to\n"
	.string "get your number?"
	.string "\pI don't want to\n"
	.string "miss anything you\l"
	.string "do from now on!$"

Johto_Std_IrwinAskNumber2Text:
	.string "You will tell me\n"
	.string "your phone number?$"

Johto_Std_IrwinNumberAcceptedText:
	.string "Wow! Gee, thanks!\n"
	.string "Now I can call you"
	.string "\panytime, whether\n"
	.string "anything's up or"
	.string "\pnot. You know,\n"
	.string "just to chat!$"

Johto_Std_IrwinNumberDeclinedText:
	.string "Oh, but…\n"
	.string "I'm not dangerous!"
	.string "\pI just want to\n"
	.string "call and chat"
	.string "\pabout everything\n"
	.string "and nothing!$"

Johto_Std_IrwinPhoneFullText:
	.string "Your phone list is\n"
	.string "already full…"
	.string "\pYou must be really\n"
	.string "popular…$"

Johto_Std_JackAskNumber1Text:
	.string "Your knowledge is\n"
	.string "impressive!"
	.string "\pI like that!"
	.string "\pWant to trade\n"
	.string "battle tips?"
	.string "\pI'll phone if I\n"
	.string "get good info."
	.string "\pWould you tell me\n"
	.string "your number?$"

Johto_Std_JackAskNumber2Text:
	.string "Want to trade\n"
	.string "battle tips?"
	.string "\pI'll phone if I\n"
	.string "get good info."
	.string "\pWould you tell me\n"
	.string "your number?$"

Johto_Std_JackNumberAcceptedText:
	.string "I'll call you if I\n"
	.string "hear anything!$"

Johto_Std_JackNumberDeclinedText:
	.string "Oh, OK. Too bad…"
	.string "\pWell, if you ever\n"
	.string "want my number,\l"
	.string "come see me, OK?$"

Johto_Std_JackPhoneFullText:
	.string "Oh?\n"
	.string "Your phone's full."
	.string "\pIt can't register\n"
	.string "my number.$"

Johto_Std_JackRematchText:
	.string "Hi, I was waiting\n"
	.string "for you to show!"
	.string "\pLet's get started\n"
	.string "right away!$"

Johto_Std_JoeyAskNumber1Text:
	.string "Listen, can I get\n"
	.string "your phone number?"
	.string "\pI'll ring you for\n"
	.string "some battles."
	.string "\pI'm a rookie too, \n"
	.string "so I think it'd be\l"
	.string "a good motivator.$"

Johto_Std_JoeyAskNumber2Text:
	.string "Can I get your\n"
	.string "phone number?"
	.string "\pI don't want to\n"
	.string "lose against you!"
	.string "\pWe have to battle\n"
	.string "again, OK?$"

Johto_Std_JoeyNumberAcceptedText:
	.string "I'll ring you\n"
	.string "whenever I get the\l"
	.string "urge to battle!$"

Johto_Std_JoeyNumberDeclinedText:
	.string "Oh, all right…"
	.string "\pBut I won't lose\n"
	.string "to you again!$"

Johto_Std_JoeyPackFullText:
	.string "Hey, wait! Your\n"
	.string "PACK is stuffed!"
	.string "\pWell, we'll leave\n"
	.string "it till next time.$"

Johto_Std_JoeyPhoneFullText:
	.string "Huh, what? Your\n"
	.string "phone's full.$"

Johto_Std_JoeyRematchGiftText:
	.string "And yet another\n"
	.string "loss…"
	.string "\pNo doubt about\n"
	.string "it--you're tough."
	.string "\pBeing beaten this\n"
	.string "often actually\l"
	.string "feels good now!"
	.string "\pHere, take this. \n"
	.string "Use it to get even"
	.string "\ptougher. That will\n"
	.string "toughen me up too!$"

Johto_Std_JoeyRematchText:
	.string "I've been waiting!\n"
	.string "Let's battle now!$"

Johto_Std_JoseAskNumber1Text:
