	.string "sees anything"
	.string "\ppretty, it goes\n"
	.string "and gets it."
	.string "\pDo you like pretty\n"
	.string "things?"
	.string "\pI could share if\n"
	.string "it gets some more."
	.string "\pWhat's your phone\n"
	.string "number? I'll call."
	.string "\pDon't expect a\n"
	.string "whole lot, OK?$"

Johto_Std_JoseAskNumber2Text:
