	.string "\pKept me waiting!\n"
	.string "Go, FARFETCH'D!$"

Johto_Std_KenjiAskNumber1Text:
	.string "Our battle was\n"
	.string "remarkable!"
	.string "\pI wish for some-\n"
	.string "thing to remember\l"
	.string "you by!"
	.string "\pPerhaps your phone\n"
	.string "number will do?"
	.string "\pMy training makes\n"
	.string "it impossible to\l"
	.string "chat much, but…$"

Johto_Std_KenjiAskNumber2Text:
	.string "My training makes\n"
	.string "chatting tough,"
	.string "\pbut will you take\n"
	.string "down my number?$"

Johto_Std_KenjiGiftText:
	.string "I wish to thank\n"
	.string "you, {PLAYER}!"
	.string "\pI've been training\n"
	.string "all alone…"
	.string "\pI was happy that\n"
	.string "you cared to call…"
	.string "\pI want you to have\n"
